    "body": "Found a nit after all. Is there a good reason to allow null here? Or would requiring undefined by fine? If there's no use case for passing null we should not allow it and change the language below from \"is non-null\" to \"is given\".\r\n\r\n(And then have an additional test that null throws.)",
