    "body": "I don't have a strong preference here, mainly I was making it consistent with [HTMLFormElement.requestSubmit](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#dom-form-requestsubmit) which allows a null `submitter`. \r\n\r\nBut I agree that allowing a null submitter but not a null form is inconsistent, so 🤷‍♂️😆",
