    "body": "Ah here's a good justification for `requestSubmit` accepting null: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3195#issuecomment-547475867\r\n\r\nSimilarly this could be useful for the `FormData` constructor, e.g. `SubmitEvent.submitter` could be null, and it would be nice to avoid null checks:\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\nmyForm.addEventListener(\"submit\", (e) => {\r\n  e.preventDefault();\r\n  const formData = new FormData(e.target, e.submitter);\r\n  // ...\r\n});\r\n```",
